summary:
  A station list taken over from the popup marks the settings page as edited.

history:
  In plasmoidviewer the settings dialog lights Apply on any change signal,
  whatever the value. The popup gave three stations their logos while the
  Stations page was open, Apply lit up with nothing changed there, and
  leaving the page asked "Apply Settings?". The takeover is quiet now; this
  sends it through the edit road instead.

target:
  package/contents/ui/config/configGeneral.qml

find:
                      for (const server of servers) stationsModel.append(server);
                      root._servers = external;

replace:
                      for (const server of servers) stationsModel.append(server);
                      root._edited();

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_a_list_taken_over_from_the_popup_is_no_edit_on_either_page,
  which the gate reaches first (unit tests run before the QML tests).
  tests/qml/tst_stationspage.qml::test_a_list_taken_over_from_the_popup_leaves_the_page_unchanged
  goes red on it as well. Line-neutral.
